Browse - the web in RISC OS
===========================

!Browse, in $.Apps, is a web browser for this desktop. It looks like
Acorn's Browse, with its button bar, URL bar and status bar with the
spinning globe, but it shows today's web pages, drawn by a real,
modern browser engine.

